<body>
    <h1>Naming Convention</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"NamingConvention-Filename">Filename</h1>
<p>Structural:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>folder name: Camel case starts Lower Case - <code>someFolder/myFolder/My=
Component.tsx</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>file name: Camel Case starts Upper Case - <code>MyComponents.tsx</code><=
/p></li>
<li>
<p>hook files: Camel case starts Lower Case - <code>useMyHook.ts</code></p>=
</li>
</ol>
<h1 id=3D"NamingConvention-Variable">Variable</h1>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>=E5=91=BD=E5=90=8D=E6=87=89=E5=9C=A8=E4=BD=BF=E7=94=A8=E6=99=82=E7=9C=8B=
=E5=88=B0=E5=8F=AF=E4=BB=A5make sense</p></li>
<li>
<p>for bool, start with <code>isxxx </code> like <code>isAllLoaded </code>a=
nd bool default should be false</p></li>
<li>
<p>for array, use <code>xxxList</code> like <code>toteList</code>, <code>or=
derList</code> <code>orders</code>, do not use <code>data</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>for dictionary, could use <code>order</code> <code>orderDetail</code></p=
></li>
</ol>
<h1 id=3D"NamingConvention-Action">Action</h1>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>get and set=E9=96=8B=E9=A0=AD=EF=BC=8C=E7=94=A8=E6=96=BC=E8=A8=AD=E5=AE=
=9A=E8=AE=8A=E6=95=B8=E6=99=82</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">setLoad=
ing() //=E8=A8=AD=E5=AE=9Aloading=E7=8B=80=E6=85=8B</pre>
</div>
</div></li>
<li>
<p>=E4=BD=BF=E7=94=A8=E5=8B=95=E8=A9=9E=E4=BD=9C=E7=82=BA=E9=96=8B=E9=A0=AD=
</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">searchT=
odoOrderList()//=E6=90=9C=E5=B0=8BOrderList</pre>
</div>
</div></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<h1 id=3D"NamingConvention-Reference">Reference</h1>
<ul>
<li>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://github.com/airbnb/javascript"=
 rel=3D"nofollow">AirBnb JavaScript Style Guide</a></p></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
